ExtensionType: 1
Name: JWT Monitor
RepoName: jwt-monitor
ScreenVersion: 1.1.1
SerialVersion: 10
MinPlatformVersion: 17
ProOnly: False
Author: Patrick Schmid (Redguard AG)
ShortDescription: Monitors a provided JWT token's expiration, replaces any outgoing requests' JWT tokens with the provided one, and pauses tasks if the token is about to expire.
EntryPoint: JWTMonitor-1.1.1-all.jar
BuildCommand: ./gradlew shadowJar
SupportedProducts: Pro, Community
